The timetables (GTFS of the long and medium distance, GTFS of the Cercanías)
and their real time (GTFS-RT trip updates, vehicle positions and service
alerts) come from the open data of Renfe (https://data.renfe.com), under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 licence:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. Source: Renfe (data.renfe.com).
The integration reads them as published; the widgets show the source (Renfe)
and the time of each reading. The files under test/fixtures are extracts of
these data (17 November 2026), kept under the same licence.

